              class="px-2.5 py-2 rounded-xl border font-bold text-xs text-center transition cursor-pointer bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800 border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-700 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 hover:border-slate-400 flex items-center justify-center gap-1"
            >
              <span>😲 Surprised</span>
